[0280] It can be understood that the cleaning action includes a first cleaning action and a second cleaning action. A first cleaning trajectory determined by performing the first cleaning action is a closed loop, and a second cleaning trajectory determined by performing the second cleaning action is capable of filling the target cleaning region.
