[0097] The peripheral area NAA may be an area covered by the bezel area BZA. The peripheral area NAA is adjacent to the active area AA. The peripheral area NAA may surround the active area AA. A driving circuit, a driving wiring, and/or the like for driving the active area AA may be disposed (e.g., positioned) in the peripheral area NAA.
