[0044] FIG. 33 illustrates the definition of bits of the stream template register for a first alternate coding of the DIMFMT field;
[0045] FIG. 34 illustrates the definition of bits of the stream template register for a second alternate coding of the DIMFMT field;
[0046] FIG. 35 illustrates the definition of bits of the stream template register for a third alternate coding of the DIMFMT field;
